        "comments": "The assembly ddPriFari1.hap1.1 is based on 123x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Some haplotypic inversions were detected on: Chromosome 2 from 53.61 to 58.58 and Chromosome 3 from 61.07 to 64 Mbp. The order and orientation of the scaffolds on Chromosome 4 from 158.24 Mbp to the end is uncertain.",
